<title>BRAZIL: MOTOR RACING-BPR GT TWO HOURS RESULT.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-BPR GT TWO HOURS RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>CURITIBA, Brazil 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the BPR GT Two Hours sportscar race on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Nelson Piquet (Brazil)/Johnny Cecotto (Venezuela) McLaren F1 GTR 88 laps</p>
<p>2. Fabien Giroix (France)/Maurizio Sala (Brazil) McLaren F1 GTR 8.826 seconds behind</p>
<p>3. John Nielsen (Denmark)/Thomas Bscher (Germany) McLaren F1 GTR 20.375 seconds</p>
</text>
